		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(40.0, 30.0, 760.0, 190.0)" font-size="16">완성본: File(학습) → Tree·kNN·Logistic Regression → Test and Score(10겹), 세 모델 → Predictions ← File(새 웨이퍼).
